<title>JAPAN: U.S. SEC making routine check of Nomura units-Jiji.</title>
<headline>U.S. SEC making routine check of Nomura units-Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Thursday that the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission was conducting a routine inspection of Nomura's U.S. units, Jiji news agency reported.  </p>
<p>Nomura Securities was also quoted as saying by Jiji that the SEC had not raised any problems with its U.S. units.</p>
</text>
